      "message": "I see the inline function has been added in a later patch...so it could be:\n```\nstatic inline void *android_task_vendor_data(struct task_struct *p)\n{\n        if (p \u003d\u003d \u0026init_task)\n            return \u0026vendor_data_pad[0];\n\treturn p + 1;\n}\n```\n\nThen you can get rid of the initialization of the last entry and reduce this to:\n```\nu64 vendor_data_pad[CONFIG_GKI_TASK_STRUCT_VENDOR_SIZE_MAX / sizeof(u64)];\n```",
